{"overview":"بلی، دختر نوجوانی پرشور و غیرمتعارف، توانایی‌های جادویی مخفی خود را کشف می‌کند؛ این توانایی‌ها او را به سفری پر از نمایش‌ها از حومه شهر به قلمرو وسیع جادوگران به نام هِکسه می‌برند. او مجبور می‌شود با مادر محتاطش، آلیس، همکاری کند و رازهای خانوادگی را کشف کند که می‌تواند دنیای جادوگران را برای همیشه تغییر دهد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"An impulsive and unconventional teenage girl named Billie discovers secret magical abilities which, once unleashed, hurtle her into a spectacle-filled journey out of suburbia and into a vast witch realm called Hexe. Forced to team up with her cautious mother, Alice, they uncover family mysteries that could change the world of witches forever.","tagline_en":"Something is happening to Billie...","runtime":103,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Jason Hand","ฝน วีระสุนทร"],"crew_en":["Jason Hand","Fawn Veerasunthorn"],"countries":["US","CA"],"cast":[{"name":"هیلی استاینفلد","role":"Billie Doe (voice)","photo":"/dxSDWkiVaC6JYjrV3XRAZI7HOSS.jpg","en":"Hailee Steinfeld"},{"name":"رشیدا جونز","role":"Alice Doe (voice)","photo":"/cgWGm9eYCretBWeljPVtpRV7n6V.jpg","en":"Rashida Jones"},{"name":"جودی فاستر","role":"Queen Celeste (voice)","photo":"/5emVgsLFlU6SmeBIFsF2Y7aqwtG.jpg","en":"Jodie Foster"},{"name":"والتون گاگینز","role":"Beef Roger Crummchuk (voice)","photo":"/5lcVMJbWrNDFiWa1WxK4oR8zwev.jpg","en":"Walton Goggins"},{"name":"هنری وینکلر","role":"Nigel (voice)","photo":"/c35LVOjB1gbY5iYzhN9PGIXUHWt.jpg","en":"Henry Winkler"},{"name":"دان استیونز","role":"Hieronymous / Crystal Ball Greeter (voice)","photo":"/fFsgginZKH527o38ZfdDxuzx7Ew.jpg","en":"Dan Stevens"},{"name":"برت گلمن","role":"Principal Huggins (voice)","photo":"/ub2IuMWFNQGYghHTPq0lpmn2Ue0.jpg","en":"Brett Gelman"},{"name":"Tracey Ullman","role":"Quill (voice)","photo":"/cmug3uUXKBo9fhCcJk3pkgt1nvM.jpg"},{"name":"استیون فرای","role":"Quire (voice)","photo":"/dH7GuUZ8QPM9RN99ak9KKOkSkdS.jpg","en":"Stephen Fry"},{"name":"Samson Kayo","role":"